flowchart TB
  accTitle: Property data flow
  accDescr: Published Supabase rows are validated and mapped to the shared model. Full inventory drives totals; filters only affect displayed cards.
  Database["SUPABASE PROPERTIES<br/>Published rows only"]
  Read["READ AND VALIDATE<br/>REST · pagination · cancellation<br/>Zod database mapping"]
  Query["SHARED QUERY<br/>React Query · 60-second stale window<br/>Explicit loading / empty / error states"]
  Summary["FULL INVENTORY TOTALS<br/>Separate USD / EUR / CHF<br/>Unweighted cap-rate mean"]
  Filter["COMBINED FILTERS<br/>Text · tier · country · currency · bedrooms"]
  URL["URL STATE<br/>Validated parameters and history"]
  Cards["FILTERED CARDS<br/>Native keyboard activation"]
  Details["SELECTED PROPERTY<br/>Public route or native dialog<br/>Shared detail content"]
  Enquiry["ENQUIRY CONTEXT<br/>Existing property and inventory<br/>Validated local preview"]
  Database --> Read
  Read --> Query
  Query --> Summary
  Query --> Filter
  URL <--> Filter
  Filter --> Cards
  Cards --> Details
  Query --> Details
  Details --> Enquiry
  classDef default fill:#ffffff,stroke:#ccd3dc,color:#172033,stroke-width:1.5px;
